# Internal working docs
docs/research/
docs/decisions/

# Plans stay local, but the deviation log /implement writes must survive to
# /validate. The `/*` matters: git cannot re-include a path whose parent
# DIRECTORY is excluded, so the obvious `docs/plans/` + negation does nothing.
docs/plans/*
!docs/plans/*-notes.md
